message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Probabilistic Vectorial Capacity Simulator"
type: software
version: "1.1"
date-released: 2026-10-01
authors:
  - family-names: Strand
    given-names: "Jackson R."
    affiliation: "Montana State University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jstrand894/vc_app"
url: "https://jstrand894.github.io/vc_app/"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An interactive tool that propagates uncertainty in transmission and mosquito
  mortality parameters through an age-specific vectorial capacity model,
  reporting the resulting distribution of vectorial capacity and a sensitivity
  ranking of the inputs.
keywords:
  - vectorial capacity
  - Monte Carlo simulation
  - uncertainty analysis
  - mosquito-borne disease
